GET /api/tarefas — lista todas as tarefas
GET /api/tarefas/{id} — retorna tarefa por id
POST /api/tarefas — cria tarefa
PUT /api/tarefas/{id} — atualiza tarefa
DELETE /api/tarefas/{id} — remove tarefa

Abra no navegador:
Listar tarefas: http://localhost:8080/api/tarefas
H2 console: http://localhost:8080/h2-console

curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/tarefas -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d 'top{"titulo":"T1","descricao":"desc1","concluida":false}'
curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/tarefas -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"titulo":"T2","descricao":"desc2","concluida":true}'
curl http://localhost:8080/api/tarefas | jq .

